flowchart TD
  A["Sandbox Runner receives FLY-202"] --> B["Acquire TURN and read branch plus PR 194"]
  B --> C["Run V1-V9 checks against current sources"]
  C -->|all pass| D["Keep sandbox-notes.md byte-identical"]
  C -->|one or more fail| E["Repair only the failed paragraph, row, bullet, or listing"]
  E --> C
  D --> F["Write final progress ledger"]
