  G --> H{"Local HEAD, remote branch, and PR head are identical?"}
  H -->|no| X["Stop and report evidence to Lead"]
  H -->|yes| I["Hand off to independent QA; keep PR open"]
  B -->|dirty, diverged, or wrong PR| X
